user.admin
  Set up an admin account that logs in with an SSH key and uses sudo
  Applies to this host.
  Arms the safety timer.

ssh.server
  Turn off root and password logins over SSH
  Applies to this host.
  Arms the safety timer.

firewall.inbound
  Drop incoming traffic that no rule allows
  Applies to this host.
  Arms the safety timer.

ssh.bruteforce
  Ban addresses that keep failing to log in over SSH
  Applies to this host.
  Does not arm the safety timer.

kernel.sysctl
  Harden kernel settings
  Does not apply to this host: kernel settings belong to the host inside a
  container.
  Does not arm the safety timer.

updates.auto
  Install security updates automatically
  Applies to this host.
  Does not arm the safety timer.

